## Set
Every element is **sorted** and **unique** automatically.

## STL Containers â€” Quick Reference

| Container | Order | Unique | Time Complexity |
|---|---|---|---|
| `map` | Sorted | Yes (key) | O(log n) |
| `unordered_map` | None | Yes (key) | O(1) avg |
| `set` | Sorted | Yes | O(log n) |
| `unordered_set` | None | Yes | O(1) avg |
| `priority_queue` | Max-heap | No | O(log n) push/pop |
| `multiset` | Sorted | No | O(log n) |

> Use `priority_queue<int, vector<int>, greater<int>>` for min-heap.
